    skos:prefLabel 'mass_concentration_of_water_vapor_in_air'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Mass concentration means mass per unit volume and is used in the construction mass_concentration_of_X_in_Y, where X is a material constituent of Y.  A chemical species denoted by X may be described by a single term such as \'nitrogen\' or a phrase such as \'nox_expressed_as_nitrogen\'.'@en ;
